{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1064074-which-webcomics-would-work-best-in-cwod","id":1064074,"title":"Which Webcomics Would Work Best in cWoD?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-17T16:25:39-07:00","id":1064074,"title":"Which Webcomics Would Work Best in cWoD?","content":"I am curious which webcomics would work best in cWoD? I would suggest El Goonish Shive or Sluggy Freelance for over-the-top versions (though El Goonish Shive vampires are quite different than cWoD vampires and Sluggy Freelance has some very powerful types of vampires). What webcomics would you suggest?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-17T17:39:37-07:00","id":1064096,"title":"","content":"Well if you want a western flavor I would suggest Guns of Shadow Valley.<br /> <br /> Lovecraft is missing was pretty good too, sadly the author died before he could finish it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-17T23:01:38-07:00","id":1064195,"title":"","content":"Yes, I liked Lovecraft is Missing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-19T00:04:06-07:00","id":1064665,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://www.girlgeniusonline.com/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">Girl Genius</a> is a wellspring of inspiration for Society of Ether Mages (or, for that matter, for the Order of Reason). It's over-the-top as all hell, but even milder implementation of its technologies could provide plenty of ideas. Moreover, it's a heavily cerebral comic. Byzantine politics abound, mixing with the natural disparity between normal folk and those with Inspired Genius.<br /> <br /> Speaking of the politics, even a Vampire game could benefit from observing the interplay of dozens of factions, their master plans crashing into one another and forcing rapid adaptation. The overarching conflict between Baron Von Wulfenbach is a good mirror for the standard animosity between an overbearing Prince and a city's resident Kindred.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-01T18:38:27-07:00","id":1328849,"title":"","content":"I think Colorblind is an inspiring web comic for Changeling. I also recommend Year in Hereafter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1869-moonwolf8","name":"moonwolf8","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-02T06:30:25-07:00","id":1328935,"title":"","content":"Kill 6 billion demons to inspire for certain places of the Umbra (Astral Hell being a primary example). Also it's a good Inspiration for several Mage themed characters and Realms (i.e:I see Demiurges as good inspiration for the kind of crazy and powerful Masters and Archmasters that have lived too long in the Umbra and lost their Humanity).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","user":"Aleph","date":". 08-02-2019, 09:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-06T18:59:09-07:00","id":1329682,"title":"","content":"Colorblind and Guns of shadow valley","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><a href=\"https://www.geometrydash.me/happy-wheels-unblocked.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">happy wheels unblocked</span></a><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\"> game, </span><a href=\"https://spanishdictionary.cc/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">spanish dictionary</span></a><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\"> online</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/255